{
  "slug": "insforge",
  "name": "Insforge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The backend platform for AI-native developers. A\nPostgres-based backend with auth, storage, compute, hosting,\nand AI gateway built for coding agents as the primary operator. Skills cover the\n@insforge/sdk surface, the @insforge/cli, debugging\ndiagnostics, and third-party integrations.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `insforge` (Use this skill when writing app code with InsForge or @insforge/sdk: database CRUD, auth, storage uploads/storage RLS, functions,…), `insforge-cli` (Use this skill whenever someone needs a backend, or a task touches InsForge backend or cloud infrastructure through…), `insforge-debug` (Use when diagnosing problems in an InsForge project — reactive failures (SDK error object, HTTP 4xx/5xx, gateway timeout…), `insforge-integrations` (Use when wiring an external auth provider (Clerk, Auth0, WorkOS, Kinde, Stytch, Better Auth) into InsForge for JWT-based…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install insforge@claude-community` from `InsForge/insforge-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
